s://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V0v0k6-MkpY\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1998844213065113733\">https://x.com/i/status/1998844213065113733</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1998851835713696140</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1998851835713696140\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-12-10T20:26:29Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>qme</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1998852673634734525":{"a":"<p>So what&#x27;s going on here? Hebrew speaking people were Persian slaves, no? Persians who likely spoke Aveston which is nearly identical to Sanskrit. Hebrew seems like a language built on overhearing your masters language and making up meaning for the words you don&#x27;t understand.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1998847686057812389\">https://x.com/i/status/1998847686057812389</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1998852673634734525</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1998852673634734525\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-12-10T20:29:48Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1998853718717132930":{"a":"<p><a href=\"https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_mrkcxXD7UfNcB1MsHPiGEyGYoKZ2qrCRw&amp;si=t-Odxrzk_fdnuDvU\">music.youtube.com/playlist?list=…</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1998510724935508103\">https://x.com/i/status/1998510724935508103</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1998853718717132930</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1998853718717132930\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-12-10T20:33:58Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>zxx</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</